{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_05_end","storyGroup":"act47side","storySort":12,"storyDependence":"act47side_level_act47side_05_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"UR-5","storyName":"注目礼","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"娜斯提找到费尔南，询问有关养母的线索，得知养母将死之际是为了她才来到这里。另一边，梅兰德应急管理监督协会迅速控制了整个园区，娜斯提被带走。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act47side/level_act47side_05_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act47side_05","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["父亲","女儿","费尔南","老伯恩","工作人员","娜斯提","虚弱的女妖","？？？","协会成员","科学顾问","高登","古斯塔夫","公司代表","雅斯彭","梅希亚","锡人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_m.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"bg","id":7,"from":"0","to":"1","duration":"0","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$blizzard","loop":"true","channel":"w","volume":"0.5","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":10},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_mouse","volume":"1","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"父亲","text":"树林里，一只沙地兽吸引了我的注意，我的常识告诉我，这种小型生物只会出现在荒野。","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"父亲","text":"它受了惊吓，往灌木丛里逃窜，好奇心驱使我向前追去，扒开荆棘和藤蔓，我的眼前出现了意想不到的景象......","id":14},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hidehaystack","volume":"1","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"父亲","text":"小费妮，你看到了吗？","id":18},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":20},{"type":"bg","id":21,"from":"1","to":"0.8","duration":"0.5","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":22},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":23},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":24},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$storyendjp_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act5d0/m_avg_storyendjp_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":25,"musicid":0},{"type":"bg","id":26,"from":"0.8","to":"0.7","duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女儿","text":"嗯！","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女儿","text":"好大一片沙漠和天空，它们接在一起的地方是粉色的，跟课本里的插图完全不一样，而且......","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女儿","text":"闻起来甜甜的。","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"父亲","text":"哈哈，那是你妈妈在烤小蛋糕，一会儿就能开饭啦。","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女儿","text":"爸爸，你再讲一遍去东部荒原探险的故事好不好？唔......不，还是讲飘浮在天上的城市吧。","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"父亲","text":"别着急孩子，奇妙的经历数不胜数，我们还有很多时间。","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"父亲","text":"等小费妮长大，小脚迈得更利索了，会见到我看到过的一切的。我向你保证。","id":34},{"type":"dialog","id":35},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"w","fadetime":"2","id":36},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":37},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":38},{"type":"charslot","id":39},{"type":"bg","id":40,"from":"0.7","to":"0","duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":41},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":42},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":43},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"3","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"true","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#6$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"你能不能别对我的客人说些有的没的？","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老伯恩","text":"是你这个实习导游没做好，他们显然更喜欢我的故事。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"我的工作是带客人游览真实存在的地方。","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老伯恩","text":"难道只有你们公司标记出来的景点才是真实存在的？荒谬，那我年轻时的那些经历算什么？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老伯恩","text":"我早就说过，你不应该照着导游手册一板一眼地讲，你要探索没人走过的路——","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"然后一事无成，被邻居嘲笑，到了晚年只能给镇上的小孩编瞎话吗？","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"我相信过你的故事——会飞的循兽、飘浮的城市、金粉色的骸骨荒原......它们现在依旧是我珍贵的回忆。","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"但你太相信自己的故事了。","id":61},{"type":"dialog","id":62},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":65},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_closedoorheavy","volume":"1","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老伯恩","text":"费尔南！咳咳，你给我回来！","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":72},{"type":"charslot","id":73},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_bg_offce.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":74},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":75},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"恭喜您，费尔南·伯恩小姐，您的资质审核已经通过，从今天起您就是独立旅行社的社长了。","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"太感谢了。虽然旅行社的成员只有我一个，但也算是顺利起步了！","id":79},{"type":"dialog","id":80},{"type":"charslot","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"一个？我记得您提交的名单上还有一位成员的名字啊，好像是......","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"马丁·伯恩，我老爹的名字，他去年就过世啦。","id":84},{"type":"dialog","id":85},{"type":"charslot","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"抱歉......","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"不用道歉，要不是他，我也不会下定决心开一家属于自己的旅行社。","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"虽然没办法跟他一起旅行，但至少在名义上，老伯恩永远是我社的重要成员。","id":91},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"charslot","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"您的父亲会很欣慰的。对了，您制定好开业后的第一条旅游路线了吗？我可以向您推荐几个热门景点。","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"唔......有没有从来没人去过的地方？","id":96},{"type":"dialog","id":97},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":98},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"charslot","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","isblock":"true","id":103},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_bg_bg_cellroomB.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"在大多数同行眼里，闯禁区只是我的商业噱头，只有我跟我的客人知道，我们见证了多少奇妙的景象，完成了多少不可能的事。","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"“螺旋桨天堂”是这趟旅程的目的地，我想提前看看未来的景象，而我的客人想实现一个模糊的心愿。","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"娜斯提主任，我真的不是故意跟莱茵作对......客人的状况不佳，我只能从同为女妖的您身上搜集线索，我——","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"不用向我道歉，费尔南小姐。我不是来兴师问罪的，我只是想知道你和你的客人的来历。","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"要是今后你出版自传，我会拜读，但现在时间有限。","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"您是在担心听证会？放心吧，召开时间一直在调整，估计是园区的调查还没结束。","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"审判会比你想象的来得更快。","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"请你尽可能简短地告诉我那名女妖客人的情况。你们在哪里相识，为什么会来这里，以及......她的身体状况如何？","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"我记得那是两个月前，在骸骨荒原......","id":124},{"type":"dialog","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":126},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":130},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"3","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"false","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"false","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":133},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#10$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#10$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"呼......晚上真冷，沙子黑乎乎的，跟老爹说的完全不一样嘛......","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"骸骨荒原的外围也没有传说中那么吓人啊，什么剔骨的风沙、冤魂的嘶鸣，我这不是好好的？","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"等等，那个山坡上的影子是什么？别真的是冤魂吧......","id":142},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"charslot","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#9$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的女妖","text":"这就是......哥伦比亚？","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#1$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的女妖","text":"“引路”。","id":148},{"type":"dialog","id":149},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_2","channel":"magic","volume":"1","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#1$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的女妖","text":"引......咳......引路......","id":153},{"type":"dialog","id":154},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_2","channel":"magic","volume":"1","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":156},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_signlntrfrnc","channel":"sign","volume":"1","id":157},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-150","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":159},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":161},{"type":"charslot","id":162},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"女士！您还好吗？","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"心跳和呼吸正常，不像是脱水了啊？不管了，先试试。","id":167},{"type":"dialog","id":168},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":170},{"type":"charslot","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#9$1","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的女妖","text":"我在......河谷？","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#4$1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的女妖","text":"不......我还没见到她，别为我哀悼，我不该栖脚......","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"女士，请冷静一点，您还记得自己的名字吗？","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#1$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的女妖","text":"不......","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"您要去哪儿？","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#1$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的女妖","text":"我......","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"您现在位于哥伦比亚的骸骨荒原，您还记得您是来做什么的吗？","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#9$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的女妖","text":"荒原......？","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#1$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的女妖","text":"不对......她不在这儿......","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"您要去找什么？我说不定可以帮您。加入费尔南旅行团，实现所有不可能的心愿，价格公道，童叟无欺。","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"我老爹常说还没实现就意味着还有希望，我老爹还说......女士？女士！","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虚弱的女妖","text":"......","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"哦，晕过去了。头上有羽角......这位女妖到底想去找什么，怎么会在骸骨荒原迷路？","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"嗯？怎么会有凭空飘浮的符号，这是哪个地区的语言？还有这些金色的纹路，它们托着薄薄的叶片......这是她的源石技艺？","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"叶尖在移动......它指的是，特区的方向？","id":203},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":205},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":206},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":207},{"type":"charslot","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","isblock":"true","id":210},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_bg_bg_cellroomB.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"后来她的记忆越来越模糊，我不知道她到底出了什么问题，只能病急乱投医。","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你无法阻止时间。","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"您是说客人的症状只是因为年迈？可她的记忆......","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"这种症状我在河谷见过，它每次出现都与死亡相伴。","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"如果一位已经开始遗忘的女妖出现在这里，那或许......","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"是她脑海里最后剩下的执念，占据了她的全部理智。","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"等等，您的意思是......","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你想替她完成的，是她的遗愿。","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"......","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"那位女士千里迢迢来到哥伦比亚，甚至在风沙肆虐的骸骨荒原徒步赶路，就是为了实现人生中的最后一个愿望？","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"她想找的究竟是什么？一件陈年旧物、一段往事的真相，还是一个她很在乎的人？","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"......","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"我明白了......","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"现在这个时间点园区的警卫都在找您，莱茵需要给园区所有人一个说法。","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"这场推迟的听证会对您而言无比重要，但您却来找一个只见过几面的导游，询问她客人的情况......","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"除非您知道那位女士在找谁，或者说——","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"娜斯提主任，她跋涉千里来到哥伦比亚就是为了......您？","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"谢谢你照顾我的母亲，费尔南小姐。","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"那位女士一定还在园区里，娜斯提主任您一定还能见到她！我可以帮您一起找！","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"来不及了。","id":253},{"type":"dialog","id":254},{"type":"charslot","id":255},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"娜斯提主任，请跟我们走一趟。","id":261},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","isblock":"true","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"再给我们几分钟，警卫先生......不对，这身制服——你们不是高登长官的人。","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"梅兰德下属的应急管理监督协会？你们的新制服还是老样式。","id":269},{"type":"dialog","id":270},{"type":"charslot","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"针对昨晚的违规装置升空事件，监督协会已在园区内进行了充分的调查，请娜斯提主任跟我们一起核实最终的调查结果。","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"如有异议，我们可以先行沟通，以免在听证会上出现不必要的误会，耽误各方时间。","id":274},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"charslot","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","isblock":"true","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"调查已经结束了......那为什么听证会还没有开始？我们都等了七个小时了！","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"听证会延迟，但审判已经开始了。","id":282},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":286},{"type":"charslot","id":287},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":290},{"type":"charslot","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#9$1","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"......","id":293},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":294},{"type":"dialog","id":295},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":296},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"charslot","id":298},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":300},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":302},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":303,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#6$1","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问","text":"......","id":305},{"type":"dialog","id":306},{"type":"charslot","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#8$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#4$1","isblock":"true","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"......","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"科学家不善言辞也就罢了，你也哑巴了？","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"当时我被选入晋升预备名单，第二天您就从总局调了一个同级的官员过来。","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"他年轻、优秀......让所有候选人躁动不安，我们争先恐后地开始向您证明，自己才是最合适的人选。","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"似曾相识不是吗？","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"最后获得晋升机会的是你。","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"本来确定的人选就是我！","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"没有什么是“确定的”，小子。","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"你真以为园区总长官是个重要的职位？不，人们只会记住在开幕直播里致辞的人。","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"而那个人，一定会是你吗？","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"......","id":331},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"高登紧盯着古斯塔夫身后的库兰塔。萨弗拉尾部的短棘根根竖起，张扬地翕动着，他在警戒。","id":334},{"type":"text","text":"他知道古斯塔夫在故意挑起自己的竞争心理，但多年的职场习惯让他无法控制地向竞争者挑衅。","id":335},{"type":"text","text":"为了从管理局离开，他揽下了不该属于自己的工作，四处打通关系，向曾经折磨自己的古斯塔夫低头。","id":336},{"type":"text","text":"绝对不能在这里停手。","id":337},{"type":"dialog","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":339},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"顾问先生，以你的高见，莱茵的装置到底是什么东西？","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问","text":"唔，可能是浮空种植单元的变体？","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"哼，那种借口——","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问","text":"不对，浮空种植单元作为空中电缆，轻便、可移动性强才契合其应用场景。","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问","text":"刚刚还看到了什么来着......树内部的启动器上有双重卡槽，是空的？","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我猜测——","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问","text":"啊，谁都能猜得出来，它们在等两把“钥匙”。","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"......","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问","text":"看来，在莱茵生命的第二个科室主任到来之前，装置树不会正式启动。不对，除非又有人在无人知情的情况下溜进园区......","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你什么意思......","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问","text":"古斯塔夫先生，人们或许会因为外观和莱茵的名头对这件装置进行揣测，但我认为它只是一棵会飞的“树”。","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你说完了？现在我们面临的问题，可不是帮莱茵写论文。","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"听证会推迟确实给了我们时间，但娜斯提为何隐瞒树的存在、费尔南是怎么混进来的，还有我的小生意......都需要合理的解释。","id":367},{"type":"dialog","id":368},{"type":"charslot","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#8$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"行了。急躁只会让你露怯，疑问越多代表你越无能。","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#8$1","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"顾问先生已经说出答案了。","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#6$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"什么？","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"莱茵的装置风险较低但又能引人揣测，所以对它的定性可大可小，不是吗？","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#6$1","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"！","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#4$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"长官，您还需要我做什么？","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"听话。","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"你只需要听话就好。","id":385},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":386},{"type":"dialog","id":387},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"charslot","id":390},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_bg_38_g13_trimountlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":391},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":392},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":394},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$newhope01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_newhope01_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":395,"musicid":2},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":396},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","volume":"0.5","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"公司代表","text":"啧，后面挤什么！","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#4$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"请、请让我过去，我想向柜台的工作人员问一些问题......","id":400},{"type":"charslot","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"公司代表","text":"她们也不知道听证会到底要拖到什么时候，别瞎费劲了。","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"我就想知道自己应不应该主动参与调查......","id":404},{"type":"charslot","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"公司代表","text":"哥们儿，我们也着急。除非你是事故的元凶或是涉案人员，不然谁都没办法推动听证会的流程啊。","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"这......","id":408},{"type":"charslot","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"公司代表","text":"看你这副着急上火的样子，你也是借了“天空贷”来的吧？","id":410},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#2$1","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"是的......在我的家乡，像我一样的杂货商足足有六个。我们每天无所事事，用风滚草的朝向赌酒，直到两年前......","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#2$1","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"天空、星荚、没有源石困扰的生活、哥伦比亚崭新的开拓区......电视和报纸上出现的全是我听不懂的东西，但那晚我确实看到了那束光。","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"我像着了迷一样，卖掉店铺，离开妻子，借下巨额的高利贷，踏入“螺旋桨天堂”，再也没回去过。","id":416},{"type":"charslot","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"公司代表","text":"唉，在注册中心的这半天，我已经听了十几个类似的故事了。领个横幅上街抗议去吧，别一脸忧愁了。","id":418},{"type":"dialog","id":419},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":420},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":421},{"type":"subtitle","text":"雅斯彭低头看着手里的抗议横幅，布料是银色的，一种飞行器常用的反光材质。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":422},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“幸运瘤兽”也用了不少这类材质的家具，雅斯彭不懂它们为什么会突然流行起来。每当他走过沙发，坐垫总会映出他的脸，很滑稽。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"750","id":423},{"type":"subtitle","text":"但每次被那些银色布料晃到眼睛的时候，他心里总会泛起一种雀跃之情，好像未来真的就在他的手里，他是被眷顾的幸运儿。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":424},{"type":"subtitle","id":425},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":426},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":427},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"我可以......我可以熬过这次听证会......","id":429},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$2","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"就算被审判、入狱，我也要把展品和“幸运瘤兽”这个名字留在“螺旋桨天堂”，留在所有人都看得见的地方。","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$2","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"我一定能等到好结果，“幸运瘤兽”会给我带来好运！","id":433},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":434},{"type":"dialog","id":435},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":436},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":437},{"type":"charslot","id":438},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":439},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":440},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":443},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":444,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"前辈从来不会迟到......是被游行的人挡住了路，还是迷路了？","id":445},{"type":"dialog","id":446},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"“螺旋桨天堂”的上下结构确实复杂，但要是把园区看作一个巨大的蓝卡坞摄影棚，那就好理解了。","id":448},{"type":"dialog","id":449},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":450},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您确实参与过蓝卡坞大片的拍摄，拓荒时代的经典佳作，至今还有人认为那身铁皮是影像合成技术的结果。","id":453},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"你的记性还是那么好，梅希亚。","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"浮空层的交通工具很有意思，柔性的钢索和球形胶囊舱的组合像是某种新型游乐设施。","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"拗不过身边的三个老家伙，我们来回转了几圈，所以耽误了时间。","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"抱歉，我还没向他们打招呼。","id":461},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"不用紧张。梅兰德的年轻特工总是过分高调，假扮秘书只有你这种稳重的孩子才合适，不过，你现在怎么一板一眼得越发严重了？","id":463,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"高登长官不好应付吧？","id":465,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#15$1","focus":"l","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"他的个性很突出，也很好懂。","id":467},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"辛苦了，梅希亚。","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"你前几天行动的时机非常好，仅带一支小队就在展会前排除了两项重大风险，我一定会写进你今年的工作评估报告里。","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"前辈谬赞。","id":473},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"现在园区的行政部和工程部双双停摆，给梅兰德创造了足够的空间。","id":475,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":476},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"古斯塔夫想跟我们合作的意图很明显，他已经在派人处理莱茵的装置。至于他手下的人，他打算亲自教导。","id":477,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"那......现在应该只差一场安抚人心的听证会了？","id":479},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"你也在疑惑听证会的时间安排，对吗？","id":481,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":482},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"前辈，拖延不像是梅兰德的作风......","id":483},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"哈哈，你什么时候也变得这么心急了？事情总要慢慢处理，调查可不是我们唯一的职责。","id":485,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"呼，真是座漂亮的未来城市，只是离开哥伦比亚几个月，这里就出现了这么多新东西。","id":487,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"沿浮空层完整绕一圈要多长时间？","id":489,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"坐索道的话，不到一个小时。","id":491},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"好，那听证会开始之前，让我再好好参观一下这座“螺旋桨天堂”吧。","id":493,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":494},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":495},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":496},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":497},{"type":"charslot","id":498},{"type":"background","id":499},{"type":"image","id":500}],"characters":["父亲","女儿","费尔南","老伯恩","工作人员","娜斯提","虚弱的女妖","？？？","协会成员","科学顾问","高登","古斯塔夫","公司代表","雅斯彭","梅希亚","锡人"]}